UID:2fb85fe24a194d9f630f9fde7098fd@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:J’ouvert is a vibrant Caribbean carnival tradition celebrate
 d annually across Caribbean communities around the world. It’s a time to
  honor our history\, embrace the future\, and come together in the spirit 
 of culture\, unity\, and joy. Come out and support CASA as we bring the en
 ergy and spirit of J’ouvert to life with paint\, rhythm\, delicious food
 \, and community! Get ready for an unforgettable day filled with culture\,
  connection\, music\, and celebration. Don’t miss it! Dress Code: Casual
  (jeans ok) --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152994
