BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Behind the Post
DTSTART:20261005T230000
DTEND:20261006T000000
DTSTAMP:20260924T160042Z
UID:dfa8413294f69262a9865d80debf6f@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Social media can skew our view of the relationships around us 
 and influence our decision to stay in unhealthy ones. Billions of photos a
 re posted to social media every day\, but you can’t always see the big p
 icture through the small ones\, especially when it comes to unhealthy rela
 tionships. Behind the Post is your go-to workshop for educating about digi
 tal consent and social media. We will explore the 10 signs of a healthy an
 d unhealthy relationship from One Love Foundation. Content Disclosure: Thi
 s event will include discussion of topics related to relationship violence
 . We encourage participants to take care of themselves and engage with the
  conversation in whatever way feels most comfortable. --- Event Details: h
 ttps://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154156\n\nSource: College of the Holy C
 ross\nEvent page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154156
LOCATION:Hogan Center 4th Floor Room 410\, The College of the Holy Cross\,
  Hogan Campus Center- Suite 506\, Worcester\, MA 01610\, United States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154156
END:VEVENT
