DESCRIPTION:Explore Salem\, Massachusetts\, a destination rich in history
 \, culture\, and coastal New England charm! Once you arrive in Salem\, the
  day is yours - for suggestions on activities or things to do\, check out 
 the Office of Student Instagram. Bus will depart from campus promptly at 1
 0:00 a.m. from Hogan Campus Center and depart from Salem by 3:30 p.m. Purc
 hase your $10 ticket on myHC. Ticket covers the cost of transportation. Al
 l other costs associated with the trip are the responsibility of the ticke
