BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Walk A Mile in Their Shoes
DTSTART:20261109T200000
DTEND:20261109T220000
DTSTAMP:20260924T160042Z
UID:c02a4899c69d46840c078de0d9a073@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Step Up. Speak Out. Create Change. Join us for an interactive 
 opportunity to show your support\, stand up for what matters\, and take ac
 tion toward creating positive change. This event will help participants bu
 ild greater understanding\, empathy\, and respect. Participants are invite
 d to walk one lap around the track\, taking time along the way to read and
  reflect on survivor stories. This shared experience is an opportunity to 
 raise awareness\, honor survivors\, and remind one another that every voic
 e and every action can make a difference. Content Warning: Survivor storie
 s may include descriptions or references to sexual violence. Please take c
 are of yourself and participate in whatever way feels comfortable for you.
  --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154158\n\nSource: 
 College of the Holy Cross\nEvent page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=
 2154158
LOCATION:The Jo indoor track\, The College of the Holy Cross\, Hogan Campu
 s Center- Suite 506\, Worcester\, MA 01610\, United States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154158
END:VEVENT
