DTEND:20270309T001500
DTSTAMP:20260924T160042Z
UID:e072a83b4e8d099992c68de34f2efe@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Your credit history can affect much more than your ability to 
 get a credit card. Learn how credit works\, what goes into your credit sco
 re\, and how to use credit cards responsibly. Whether you’re building cr
 edit for the first time or already have a card in your wallet\, you’ll l
 earn strategies that can help you establish a strong credit history and av
 oid costly mistakes. We’ll cover: ● What a credit score is—and why i
 t matters ● How credit scores are calculated ● Building credit from sc
 ratch ● Choosing and using a credit card ● Interest rates\, minimum pa
 yments\, and fees ● Credit utilization and payment history ● Common cr
 edit mistakes and how to avoid them Meeting Link: TBD --- Event Details: h
 ttps://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403499\n\nSource: Worcester Polytechnic Insti
 tute\nEvent page: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403499
LOCATION:Online Event
URL:https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403499
END:VEVENT
